      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRISH CARLA (3) was a course and distance placegetter (17.03) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 3 length second in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks hard to top. BEAUTY BEAST (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a long neck at this track in a handy 17.03 beating Path To Nirvana. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Form should stack up. JAICOS (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 3rd at Shepparton over 390m. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Hard to beat again. HERBIE (1) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
